  m_Name: NPC Sett
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  lines:
  - "Kh\xE1 l\u1EAFm nh\xF3c con."
  - "\u0110\xFAng l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\u1ECDn."
  - "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 kh\u1EA3 n\u0103ng phong \u1EA5n con qu\xE1i
    v\u1EADt \u0111\xF3."
  - "B\u01B0\u1EDBc qua c\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng..."
  - "...v\xE0 ch\u1EA5m d\u1EE9t c\u01A1n \xE1c m\u1ED9ng n\xE0y."
